iagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass"},"testCase":{"id":"cabc78dd0e88f811788f3d26fc706267","externalId":"41b0c715ede4ee806e611765b2f43a41","name":"[dev] S20 Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S20"},"descriptionHtml":"<p><b>Case priority: P1 · our extension of a stated behaviour</b> · ours: fast re-type and whitespace-only query.</p><div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S20</b> Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts</p><p><b>UAT steps / ticket ACs covered:</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own. (UAT TC-03; TFA-92581 AC 2; TFA-92581 AC 5)</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own. (UAT TC-03; TFA-92581 AC 3; TFA-92581 AC 6)</li></ul><p><b>Test design technique: </b>Error guessing (error-guessing) — Go straight for the places most likely to break (failures, double clicks, two tabs, a wrong clock, injected instructions).</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: type 'pneumonia' and, without waiting, replace it with 'zz-no-match-zz'; clear it; type three spaces. Nursing Home Today's Visits: type 'QA Resident' and, without waiting, replace it with 'zz-no-match-zz'; clear it; type three spaces</p><p><b>Then </b>After the second query the record is not listed and the no-match message shows (no stale results from the first query). After Clear it is back. Spaces alone show the full list, not a no-match message. Same in both contexts</p><p><b>Pass rule (oracle, excerpt): </b>oracle.mjs: cp1 mustContain 'No patients match', mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}; cp2 mustContain {hospitalPatient}; cp3 mustContain {hospitalPatient}, mustNotContain 'No patients match'; cp4 mustContain 'No residents match', mustNotContain {snfResident}; cp5 mustContain {snfResident}; cp6 mustContain {snfResident}, mustNotContain 'No residents match' (U1, U4)</p><p><b>Where it ran: </b>dev unit U23; test method AGENT · Browser agent; lane planned in the matrix: browser agent (automated)</p><p><small>S20 is our own case number (its number in the coverage matrix cases/TC-03.matrix.json), not a step number of the UAT document.</small></p></div><p><b>Environment: dev</b> — dev deployment, build <code>8b4be94</code> (Deploy Convex, 2026-10-19T17:04:37Z); account and address are not written into the report; run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>.</p><p><b>Test method:</b> AGENT · Browser agent — as classified in cases/test-methods.json, which says it runs on both; Source: <code>dev</code>.</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S20</p><p><b>Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U23.verdict.json</code>), unit U23 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 263 s, $0.60.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U23 (#23, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Search box, both contexts. Same legacy seed, same search box, read-only typing (diagnosis words, names / MRN across contexts, fast re-type and whitespace). No part opens a chart or changes a row. Runs together with TC-03/S07, TC-03/S17.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #23, U23; checked: yes): <b>Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1)</b> — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S20 Fast re-type and a whitespace-only query, both contexts"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"6bc8d171fdd895d16e4e017228528ea9","originalFileName":"aebee9da-982d-443a-963a-12956c188fca-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":1982},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"f780be121ee632f58bdab2946846833e","originalFileName":"91460742-0b94-4267-ae4a-39995642df9b-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":66707},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"c251ae45aef281e6a4b929d234e087ba","originalFileName":"1017c6bb-7d24-4a75-815f-9da444d88bb2-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2497,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"7aef1543f6021e0f6dedda081a22d24f","originalFileName":"51d10a73-343e-437e-8a2f-d245d92535a3-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":77881},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"4634dc2caea677157c095d3d6a6627e2","originalFileName":"76dd5cad-4f3e-476d-8f85-58500dcebe26-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2584},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"8bd8f758e3ae8a7ab090e3c1089008d9","originalFileName":"71452ba7-6c77-4a39-a196-be9aca756b57-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":74431},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"ceb99665d48821e59da01e641250e520","originalFileName":"36dd8faa-5918-45d6-8244-323a5af34af8-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":1828},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"use